.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_KEYEXCH-X25519 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_KEYEXCH-X25519 ,
.Nm EVP_KEYEXCH-X448
.Nd X25519 and X448 Key Exchange algorithm support
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Key exchange support for the
.Sy X25519
and
.Sy X448
key types.
.Ss Key exchange parameters
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqpad" ( Ns Sy OSSL_EXCHANGE_PARAM_PAD Ns ) <unsigned integer>
.It \(dqfips-indicator" ( Ns Sy OSSL_EXCHANGE_PARAM_FIPS_APPROVED_INDICATOR Ns ) <integer>
.Sy X25519
and
.Sy X448
are not FIPS approved in FIPS 140-3. So this getter will return 0.
.Pp
See
.Xr provider-keyexch 7 .
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Keys for the host and peer can be generated as shown in
.Xr EVP_PKEY-X25519 7 .
.Pp
The code to generate a shared secret is identical to
.Xr EVP_KEYEXCH-DH 7 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr EVP_PKEY-FFC 7 ,
.Xr EVP_PKEY-DH 7
.Xr EVP_PKEY 3 ,
.Xr provider-keyexch 7 ,
.Xr provider-keymgmt 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-default 7 ,
.Xr OSSL_PROVIDER-FIPS 7 ,
